{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "037jir_401_2_4_037_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0b8bfbc1326057aa351c29b238214330b6e5d204aa5314cd4c93f21b174c3cd7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:037jir_401_2_4_037_01_09_a:2_4_037_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee72847603d9afde7d144c7257a5018b2f4ad6c6672fc6a890140cca7738c959",
      "text": "喂喂，●●●●プロデューサー酱？\n这么晚打扰真不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_401_2_4_037_01_09_a:2_4_037_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c8118f80fe7afb8998b4561e5b3c9c1d516a6fb7ef4a7de980cac108ac904e1",
      "text": "类和硲先生现在在我家里，\n聊起了音乐节的事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_401_2_4_037_01_09_a:2_4_037_01_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a334ea6a25071b0c5090e4b5e1879b1be0ddd790946b0139a3332d0929d13b6",
      "text": "聊着聊着不知不觉就热闹起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_401_2_4_037_01_09_a:2_4_037_01_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b0163f27a60a22c1d6266cce5bccf9d0fe36e7c44e96b543f5c7000212f3bca",
      "text": "硲先生说要根据需要改善的地方开展训练课，\n类也表示赞同呢～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_401_2_4_037_01_09_a:2_4_037_01_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1c301229430c9e469e4d4d150dd7df1893964b100043fb00495fcb824d2c06f",
      "text": "所以事情就变成明天马上开始练了，\n不知道训练室空着没有呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_401_2_4_037_01_09_a:2_4_037_01_09_a:cmd-000018:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:039f26d43aa4e09985cab3732311375122ee4e1540bec2d962ac636d970563bc",
      "text": "我确认一下。\n稍后联络您。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_401_2_4_037_01_09_a:2_4_037_01_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d4b73b843a1a9a9470b3db8b1440db534739e55488b86721e8cab9004f64ed2",
      "text": "谢谢你啦。帮大忙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_401_2_4_037_01_09_a:2_4_037_01_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:969af352b1cf6e5ea4bf743f4f8f1a7dd7e44b35bc61e2dd03ee83857ff4ad00",
      "text": "……咦？饮料已经没了吗？\n真拿你们没办法啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:037jir_401_2_4_037_01_09_a:2_4_037_01_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c33aea75981469d08dfc6d130bb74af26798e7b31f482bb4d7a266e8e75fa6b4",
      "text": "啊，抱歉说到一半走神了。那之后就\n拜托你咯，●●●●プロデューサー酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
